clean_text:
[bug] Google / Gemini 个人账号额度同步报错「未返回 Code Assist 项目」（附根因分析与 Antigravity CLI 适配方案）
## 环境信息

- **知屿版本**：`v1.17.12`（桌面端，涉及 `electron/services/ai-accounts.mjs` 及前端 AI 账号说明文案）
- **复现渠道**：`AI 订阅` → `Google / Gemini` OAuth 授权

---

## 问题现象

使用个人 Google 账号（含 Free / Google AI Pro / Google AI Ultra）完成 `Google / Gemini` 网页登录授权后，令牌保存正常，但刷新额度始终失败并提示：

> `Google 未返回 Code Assist 项目，请先在 Gemini CLI 完成账号开通。`

同时「授权返回的套餐」显示为 `服务商未返回`。即使本机已在最新版 ` /gemini-cli`（`v0.68.0`）完成 `oauth-personal` 登录，问题依然存在。

---

## 根因分析

### 1. Google 官方已永久下线原版 Gemini CLI 的个人版 OAuth 通道
目前 `AI_PROVIDERS.gemini` 使用原 Gemini CLI 公开分发的桌面 OAuth 客户端请求 ` 时，Google 服务端对个人消费者账号（`free-tier`）已停止支持，不再返回 `currentTier`、`paidTier` 和 `cloudaicompanionProject`，而是在 `ineligibleTiers` 中返回 `UNSUPPORTED_CLIENT`：

```json
{
"allowedTiers": [
{
"id": "standard-tier",
"name": "Gemini Code Assist",
"userDefinedCloudaicompanionProject": true,
"isDefault": true,
"usesGcpTos": true
}
],
"ineligibleTiers": [
{
"reasonCode": "UNSUPPORTED_CLIENT",
"reasonMessage": "This client is no longer supported for Gemini Code Assist for individuals. To continue using Gemini, please migrate to the Antigravity suite of products:
"tierId": "free-tier",
"tierName": "Gemini Code Assist for individuals"
}
]
}
```

> 补充验证：若显式传入个人账号下的自定义 GCP 项目 ID，`loadCodeAssist` 虽会回显项目 ID，但下一步 `retrieveUserQuota` 会因缺少企业版付费订阅直接返回 `HTTP 403 SUBSCRIPTION_REQUIRED (#3501)`。

### 2. 错误兜底文案掩盖了服务端返回的 `ineligibleTiers` 原因
`electron/services/ai-accounts.mjs` 中仅判断 `!profile.cloudaicompanionProject` 就统一抛出 `"Google 未返回 Code Assist 项目，请先在 Gemini CLI 完成账号开通。"`，没有读取 `profile.ineligibleTiers?.[0]?.reasonMessage`，容易误导用户反复重登已停用的 Gemini CLI。

---

## 解决方法与参考实现（已在 v1.17.12 实测通过）

Google 已将个人开发额度合并至官方 **Antigravity CLI（`agy`）**。`agy` 官方公开支持非交互式打印模式读取配额与积分（纯 TSV 输出，无 ANSI 转义符）：

- `agy -p "/usage" --print-timeout 20s` 输出示例：
```text
Gemini Models Weekly Limit Remaining 94% 2026-11-20T22:51:38Z
Gemini Models Five Hour Limit Remaining 98% 2026-11-15T14:23:38Z
Claude and GPT models Weekly Limit Remaining 57% 2026-11-17T18:29:42Z
Claude and GPT models Five Hour Limit Remaining 51% 2026-11-15T14:28:12Z
```
- `agy -p "/credits" --print-timeout 20s` 输出示例：
```text
Remaining credits 0
```

### 建议改造方案

1. **保留 GCP 企业版兼容**：`refresh()` 仍先请求 `loadCodeAssist`，若返回有效 `cloudaicompanionProject`（企业席位），继续走原有 `retrieveUserQuota`。
2. **桌面端自动回退本机 `agy` CLI（并透传真实 `ineligibleTiers` 报错）**：
- 桌面端当 `cloudaicompanionProject` 为空时，通过 `execFile`（`windowsHide: true`，不经过 shell）调用本机 `agy -p "/usage"` 与 `agy -p "/credits"` 解析额度（注意 GUI 启动时需兜底常见安装路径，如 Windows `%LOCALAPPDATA%\agy\bin\agy.exe`、macOS/Linux `~/.local/bin/agy`、`/opt/homebrew/bin/agy`）。
- 若本机未安装或未登录 `agy`（或处于自托管 Web 端不便调用宿主机 CLI 时），优先将 `profile.ineligibleTiers?.[0]?.reasonMessage` 透传给用户，不再提示去 Gemini CLI 开通。
- **多账号边界说明**：回退模式下读取的是本机当前 `agy` 登录账号的额度，建议在 `scopeNote` 中注明。
3. **直接复用现有前端标签字典与历史记录**：
将窗口 `label` 组装为 `Gemini Models/five_hour`、`Gemini Models/seven_day`、`Claude & GPT/five_hour`、`Claude & GPT/seven_day`、`credits/AI Credits`，无需改动渲染组件即可命中现有的 `/` 分段标签翻译（`5 小时` / `7 天` / `积分`），且天然兼容 `UsageStore.recordAccount()`。

### 核心参考代码（`electron/services/ai-accounts.mjs`）

```js
function resolveAgyBinary() {
const home = homedir();
const candidates =
process.platform === "win32"
? [
join(process.env.LOCALAPPDATA || join(home, "AppData", "Local"), "agy", "bin", "agy.exe"),
join(home, ".gemini", "antigravity-cli", "bin", "agy.exe"),
]
: [
join(home, ".local", "bin", "agy"),
join(home, ".agy", "bin", "agy"),
"/opt/homebrew/bin/agy",
"/usr/local/bin/agy",
];
for (const candidate of candidates) {
try {
accessSync(candidate, fsConstants.F_OK);
return candidate;
} catch {}
}
return process.platform === "win32" ? "agy.exe" : "agy";
}

function execAgySlash(bin, slashCommand, timeoutMs = 25000) {
return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {
execFile(
bin,
["-p", slashCommand, "--print-timeout", "20s"],
{
windowsHide: true,
timeout: timeoutMs,
maxBuffer: 1024 * 1024,
env: { ...process.env, NO_COLOR: "1" },
},
(error, stdout, stderr) => {
if (error) reject(Object.assign(error, { stdout, stderr }));
else resolve(String(stdout ?? ""));
},
);
});
}

export async function readAntigravityCliUsage(ineligibleMessage = "") {
const bin = resolveAgyBinary();
let usageText = "";
try {
usageText = await execAgySlash(bin, "/usage");
} catch (error) {
const detail = ineligibleMessage ? `（${ineligibleMessage}）` : "";
const reason =
error?.code === "ENOENT"
? "未检测到本机 Antigravity CLI (agy)，请先安装并登录 agy。"
: "调用本机 Antigravity CLI (agy -p /usage) 失败，请确认已完成 agy 登录。";
throw new AiServiceError("ANTIGRAVITY_REQUIRED", `${reason}${detail}`);
}

const parsedWindows = [];
for (const rawLine of usageText.split(/\r?\n/)) {
const line = rawLine.trim();
if (!line || !line.includes("\t")) continue;
const [poolRaw = "", windowRaw = "", remainingRaw = "", resetRaw = ""] = line
.split("\t")
.map((part) => part.trim());
const match = /^(\d+(?:\.\d+)?)%$/.exec(remainingRaw);
if (!match || !poolRaw) continue;
const remainingPct = Math.max(0, Math.min(100, Number(match[1])));
const usedPercent = Math.round((100 - remainingPct) * 100) / 100;
const isFiveHour = /five\s*hour|5\s*hour|\b5h\b/i.test(windowRaw);
const isWeekly = /week|seven\s*day|7\s*day|\b7d\b/i.test(windowRaw);
const windowKey = isFiveHour ? "five_hour" : isWeekly ? "seven_day" : str(windowRaw || "quota");
const windowSeconds = isFiveHour ? 18000 : isWeekly ? 604800 : undefined;
const poolLabel = /^Claude and GPT models$/i.test(poolRaw) ? "Claude & GPT" : str(poolRaw);
parsedWindows.push({
label: `${poolLabel}/${windowKey}`,
usedPercent,
resetsAt: iso(resetRaw),
...(windowSeconds ? { windowSeconds } : {}),
model: str(poolRaw),
_poolRank: /^Gemini/i.test(poolRaw) ? 0 : 1,
_winRank: windowSeconds ?? 999999,
});
}
parsedWindows.sort((a, b) => a._poolRank - b._poolRank || a._winRank - b._winRank);
const antigravityWindows = parsedWindows.map(({ _poolRank, _winRank, ...item }) => item);

try {
const creditsText = await execAgySlash(bin, "/credits", 15000);
for (const rawLine of creditsText.split(/\r?\n/)) {
const match = /^Remaining credits\t(\d+(?:\.\d+)?)$/i.exec(rawLine.trim());
if (match) {
const creditVal = amount(match[1]);
if (creditVal !== undefined) {
antigravityWindows.push({
label: "credits/AI Credits",
usedPercent: null,
remaining: creditVal,
unit: "credits",
resetsAt: null,
});
}
}
}
} catch {}

if (!antigravityWindows.length) {
throw new AiServiceError(
"ANTIGRAVITY_EMPTY",
"本机 Antigravity CLI 未返回可解析的模型额度，请运行 agy 检查登录状态。",
);
}
return {
_source: "antigravity-cli",
_scope: "Antigravity CLI",
_scopeNote: "此处通过本机 Antigravity CLI (agy) 读取当前登录账号的模型池与 AI Credits 额度。",
plan_type: "Antigravity",
antigravityWindows,
};
}
```

在 `refresh()` 的 `gemini` 分支中：

```js
const tier = profile?.paidTier ?? profile?.currentTier;
account.plan = str(tier?.name ?? tier?.id) || account.plan;
if (
typeof profile?.cloudaicompanionProject === "string" &&
profile.cloudaicompanionProject
) {
usage = await readUsage(p.usage, {
method: "POST",
headers,
body: JSON.stringify({ project: profile.cloudaicompanionProject }),
});
usage.availableCredits = tier?.availableCredits;
} else {
const ineligibleReason = str(array(profile?.ineligibleTiers)[0]?.reasonMessage);
usage = await readAntigravityCliUsage(ineligibleReason);
}
```

